          "degreeType": "MASTER",
          "summary": {
            "text": "A two-year, English-taught Master of Science and Technology track at École Polytechnique worth 140 ECTS credits, focused on building AI applications that are not only effective but also trustworthy, transparent and responsible. Teaching covers sustainable AI including energy-efficient models and parameter optimisation, trustworthy and secure AI spanning privacy, safety, adversarial robustness and regulatory compliance, and AI transparency and explainability through interpretability methods, decision trees and knowledge graphs.",
